OL,3,AUS slaps import ban on Canadian alcohol
OL,4,Aand other goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth US and Canadian officials have
OL,7,Fsaid they would like to strike a trade
OL,8,Fdeal, but no new talks have been
OL,9,Fscheduled since negotiations collapsed
OL,10,Fin late August.
